            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Ilai 23.36–24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te nkiterunoto e nkitoria e Yohoiakim olayioni le Yosia, olaiguanani le Yuda, ele rorei oewuo eing'uaa Olaitoriani ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ntasho to lgoriet le nkaji o Laitoriani nirorie nena anas pooki e Yuda naapuonu aaserem tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani kulo rorei pooki laaitanap nanu iyie tiaaki ninche; mimbooyo ake ororei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eidimayu nening ninche; neibelekenya pooki ng'ae aing'uaa enkoitoi enye torrono, pee atum nanu aibelekenyayu teina torroni apa natonyorra ajo kaitaas ninche tenkaraki nkiaasin enye torrok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiaaki iyie ninche, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Tinimikining'ning'i intae nanu, pee ipuopuo te nkitanapata ai nairragie nanu te dukuya intae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nining'ining'i irorei loo sinkan laainei lelo oibonok le Nkai lairriwaka nanu intae te siokinoto, hoo neitu intae ining'ining'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.18.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 18.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.60"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 78.60",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.12+JER.7.13+JER.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naitotiu nanu ena aji anaa Shilo, naa kaitaa sii ena anasa oldeket too loreren pooki le nkop.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etoning'o ilapolosak o loibonok o ltung'ana pooki Yeremia eirorita kulo rorei tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip Yeremia airoro ina pooki naitanapa Olaitoriani ninye pee eirorie iltung'ana pooki, neibung ilapolosak ninye, o loibonok, iltung'ana pooki ejoito, ejo, “Iye iyie! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo iyie pee imbonishe te nkarna o Laitoriani, ijo, ‘Keyooki ena aji atiu anaa Shilo ore ena anasa neaku olmuaate memanya toki’?” Ore iltung'ana pooki neiturrurrokino Yeremia tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee ening ilkituaak le Yuda kuna baa, nepuonu te nkaji o laiguanani enkaji o Laitoriani netonie olorika lenye tenejing'ieki kishomi ng'ejuk eina aji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilapolosak o loibonok lelo kituaak o lelo tung'ana pooki, “Eishaakino ele endung'okinoto e nkiguana e keeya, enkaraki naibonoko te ntorroni ena anasa, anaa enitoning'o too nkiyiaa inyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yeremia airorie lelo kituaak pooki o ltung'ana pooki ejo, “Olaitoriani, laairriwua maibonoki entorroni ena aji o ena anasa lelo rorei pooki litoning'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata entobira nkoitoi inyi o nkiaasin inyi, nining'ining'i oltoilo lo Laitoriani Enkai inyi, naa keirridu Olaitoriani te ina torrono natudung'ie enkiguana tialo intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore nanu, ng'ura atii atua nkaik inyi. Entaasaki nanu anaa enidolidolo aa sidai neishiaakino te intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entayiolo ake duoo intae te nkitisipata nchere tenikiariara nanu matua, niyauu osarge lemeeta eleyiata shumata intae maate o shumata ena anasa o lelo oomanya, amu ore te sipata o Laitoriani laairriwua nanu enitii pee airo kulo rorei pooki ootii nkiyiaa inyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki lelo kituaak o ltung'ana pooki lelo apolosak o loibonok, “Meishiaakino ele tung'ani endung'okinoto e nkiguana e keeya, amu eirorie ninye iyiook te nkarna o Laitoriani Enkai ang.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo embata oo lpayiani leina kop neirorie ina umata pooki oo ltung'ana ejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 3.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore apa Mika le Moreshet neibonishe too nkolong'i e Hesekia olaiguanani le Yuda, nejoki iltung'ana pooki le Yuda: ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, keturi sion anaa enkurma neaku Yerusalem osototi loo suut ore enkaji e Nkai neaku entim oo lkeek.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ketaara ninye metua Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda o Yuda pooki? Keitu ninye eureyu Olaitoriani nesayu esupatisho o Laitoriani, naa keitu ninye eirridu Olaitoriani te ina torroni apa natudung'oko ninche? Kake etaa iyiook enikijo pee kiyau entorroni shumata ate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii sii likae tung'ani oibonishe te nkarna o Laitoriani, Uria olayioni le Shemia eing'uaa Kiriat-Yearim. Eibonuo entorroni tialo ena anasa o ena kop too rorei ooikununo anaa kuldo le Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ening olaiguanani Yehoiakim, tenebo enjore enye pooki o lkituaak pooki, irorei lenyena, neing'oru olaiguanani ajo aar ninye metua; kake ore ake pee ening Uria ina, neureisho neisikalo aisudori te Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa olaiguanani Yehoiakim kulikae tung'ana meshomo Misiri, Elnatan olayioni le Akbo o kulikae tenebo ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyau ninche Uria aaitung'uaa Misiri neyaki ninye olaiguanani Yehoiakim, laa ninye otaara ninye to lalem nenang'aki empopok enye atua ewueji e nkurare oo ltung'ana pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
